  <h1>The Bitcoin <em>Floor</em></h1>
  <div class="hero-subtitle">Every model needs a place where it can fail. This is bitcoin&rsquo;s &mdash; a line under fifteen years of price history, touched four times, broken once, and watched live every day.</div>

